### Register a new user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "tester",
  "email": "tester@example.com",
  "password": "password"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "alice",
  "password": "password"
}

### Create a post (requires ACCESS_TOKEN cookie)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: ACCESS_TOKEN={{token}}

{
  "content": "Hello from HTTP file!",
  "imageUrl": null
}

### List feed
GET http://localhost:8080/api/feed?sort=new
Cookie: ACCESS_TOKEN={{token}}

### Toggle like
POST http://localhost:8080/api/posts/{{postId}}/likes/toggle
Cookie: ACCESS_TOKEN={{token}}


### Upload media (multipart, field name "file") -> 201 {"mediaUrl": "/media/<uuid>.<ext>"}
POST http://localhost:8080/api/media
Cookie: ACCESS_TOKEN={{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=Boundary

--Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="clip.mp4"
Content-Type: video/mp4

< ./clip.mp4
--Boundary--
